<title>CHINA: HK to boost residential land supply in 1997-2002.</title>
<headline>HK to boost residential land supply in 1997-2002.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Secretary for Planning, Environment and Lands announced on Tuesday a five-year land disposal programme which would raise residential land supply by 140 percent compared with the previous five years.</p>
</text>
